              },
              "blocks": {
                "accordion_row_XdEepH": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Our Quality Standard",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "check_box",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_BtQAUd": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<h2><strong>Built for Heavy Rotation</strong></h2><p>Every piece is engineered to handle real wear, not just photo shoots. We control fabric, print, and construction so your favorite tee still feels and looks right after countless washes.</p><h2><strong>Zero Shortcuts, Ever</strong></h2><p>From yarn selection to final inspection, we reject anything that doesn’t meet our internal benchmarks. If it wouldn’t make our own rotation, it never reaches yours.</p><h2><strong>Precision in Every Detail</strong></h2><p>Seams, prints, and fit are measured against strict tolerances on every production run. That’s how we deliver a consistent, premium feel, drop after drop, size after size.</p>",
                        "bleed": false,
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
                        "alignment": "center",
                        "type_preset": "custom",
                        "font": "var(--font-secondary--family)",
                        "font_size": "var(--font-size--body-lg)",
